1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,680
It was 2012 in the Ethiopian calendar.
At midday I left Ankober.

2
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:09,950
Just one backpack. A friend saw me off.

3
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:15,950
The road was gravel as far as Debre
Birhan. After that, asphalt.

4
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:21,530
I sat by the window of the bus. Outside,
forest and mountains.

5
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:23,367
The view was amazing.

6
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:30,267
I reached Lamberet after dark. My friend
was there, waiting for me.

7
00:00:30,267 --> 00:00:32,387
People, lights, cars:

8
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:34,033
everything at once.

9
00:00:38,733 --> 00:00:42,943
At Autobus Tera the brokers closed in on
us.

10
00:00:42,943 --> 00:00:47,893
"Do you want a bed?" "A bed?" From every
side. We were lost.

11
00:00:47,893 --> 00:00:50,575
In the end we picked one.

12
00:00:51,275 --> 00:00:58,575
The room had one bed. Not very good, not
bad. It was clean.

13
00:00:59,275 --> 00:01:04,075
In the morning we stood in a long queue
and got the ticket.

14
00:01:04,775 --> 00:01:11,945
That night confused me. Today I tell
everyone who leaves home one thing:

15
00:01:11,945 --> 00:01:17,908
the first night is always confusing. Do
not run from it. Savour it.

